<title>USA: Mid-America Apartment to sell stock.</title>
<headline>Mid-America Apartment to sell stock.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc said Tuesday it planned to sell 1.2 million shares of its Series A Cumulative Preferred Stock in a public offering.</p>
<p>The company said it would sell the shares at $25 each.</p>
<p>It said it would use the money raised from the sale to finance acquisitions and reduce outstanding debt under its $65 million credit line.</p>
<p>Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc is a real estate investment trust.</p>
